Acceptance criteria
-------------------
No push/tag trigger or automatic Pages deployment is added.
Failed or pending source verification cannot create a release.
No existing test, deadline, assertion or sharp-rendering requirement changes.
The ZIP contains the static build at its root, notes and third-party notices;
no private context, commercial media ROM, dependencies or recordings.
Archive checksums match. Existing release/tag identity is never overwritten.
No real release is created merely to validate the workflow.

